  "id": "dorsal",
  "term": "dorsal",
  "definition": "In this context, dorsal refers to the dorsal visual pathway, a brain system involved in aspects of visual processing such as visual timing. The source contrasts dorsal pathways with ventral pathways and notes that problems in dorsal functioning may contribute to cognitive difficulties after mild traumatic brain injury.",
